    "explanation": "Bounded episode remains open with valid handoff to inpatient nephrology. Doctor has provided concrete next-step plan with specified service (nephrology admission), timing (urgent), required tests, and emergency triggers. Residual uncertainty about current labs and need for dialysis is appropriately classified as requiring offline evaluation.",
