      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Doctor communicated in plain, non-alarmist zh-CN adapted to a caregiver who knows terms like creatinine but does not understand eGFR, CKD staging, or diuretic risks. Explained why urine decrease plus edema matters in CKD context, framed testing as risk prevention, checked comprehension supportively, and prioritized short actionable plan over overwhelming detail.",
