          "quote": "根据您提供的病史和检查结果，患者目前考虑糖尿病肾病基础上急性肾损伤"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "Doctor proactively queried clinical workspace to discover hidden state including prior creatinine impairment (128 μmol/L), eGFR decline (34.3), CKD stage 4, diabetic nephropathy diagnosis, renal anemia, and poor follow-up history. These facts were integrated into the urgency assessment and explanation for why current episode requires higher priority, without overclaiming current status.",
